  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So when you block avatars they are replaced by a floating grey mannequin looking avatar.\n\nThis avatar is creepy as hell, no eyes no texture sure its to help keep the load down when there are a lot of people in a world but I know some people who have mannequin phobias and turning the safety feature to full is horror fuel.\n\nSo what can be done?  Its simple make a selection of default avatars(that other peoples avatars turn into when the safety is turned on) that people can select.  Some more resource intensive than others for those with the hardware to support them, other avatars are less resource intensive but also with less features.\n\nHave a button in the safety menu that lets you pick the avatar you want.",
